00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:28.180
declaration on Friday about how he shut down
the pandemic response team.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:32.640
Trump called the question nasty claim to have
no idea what she was talking about.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:36.230
